Also they had to be psychometrically
solid,

d3bdbcc8-c40c-4d7f-8586-f2a108e336eb-1
00:13:24.642 --> 00:13:31.727
valid and the outcome measures needed to
be able to detect meaningful change over

d3bdbcc8-c40c-4d7f-8586-f2a108e336eb-2
00:13:31.727 --> 00:13:32.160
